# Trivy suppressions for the Trivy Image Scan workflow (.github/workflows/trivy.yml).
# Trivy reads this file from the checkout root automatically. Every entry needs a
# justification and a revisit trigger; never add an ID here just to go green.

# pip 26.2.1 vendors msgpack 1.1.2 and a partial setuptools 70.3.0 (pkg_resources
# only) in pip/_vendor/vendor.txt. That code only runs when pip itself runs, and the
# api image never invokes pip after the build step (see server/scripts/start.sh).
# Revisit: remove once pip ships a release vendoring msgpack>=1.2.1 / setuptools>=78.1.1.
